21,0:01:27.17,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,まDialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:37.34,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:37.34,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.10,0:01:37.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,イエス・Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.06,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,イエス・Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:37.76,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,ウィーDialogue: 1,0:01:37.76,0:01:38.19,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,ウィーDialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:37.89,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,キャン！Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.89,0:01:38.94,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,キャン！Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:45.65,Title,,0,0,240,,A World AbuzzDialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.40,Captions,,0,0,240,,Alabasta The Kingdom of SandDialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,All aboard!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:06.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.09,0:02:09.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koza.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:27.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Vivi-chan looked very excited.Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess her pirate spirit is back.Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.18,0:02:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when I was thinking  she had become more like a princess.Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Hina. We just left Alabasta.Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:44.62,Main,,0,0,3,,We'll get the Nefertari Family to Mariejois safely.Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:45.47,Captions,,0,0,240,,Navy HQ Rear Admiral, "Black Cage" HinaDialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:47.46,Main,,0,0,3,,Hina-sama, accept these flowers!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I picked them for you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want them.Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:54.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Jango! Fullbody! Get to your positions now!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Vivi-sama! Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:09.48,Main,,0,0,3,,Please come down from there this instant!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:11.83,Captions,,0,0,240,,Princess of the Alabasta Kingdom Nefertari ViviDialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.92,Main,,0,0,3,,Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What a nice sea breeze...Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What would you do if a strange bird comes and grabs you?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,And what if there's a sniper targeting you, or if a meteor falls from the sky?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You worry too much.Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:30.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Vivi-sama used to be a pirate, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:36.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Pell?! The Navy is watching us!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're not feeling well, we'll head back right away.Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:48.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:56.13,Main,,0,0,3,,Ever since I met Nico Robin, I've wanted to ask the World Government something.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:56.13,Captions,,0,0,240,,King of the Alabasta Kingdom Nefertari CobraDialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:59.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was to know the history...Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:05.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There are too many enemies in the way of my dream...Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,About the Poneglyphs?Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm determined to attend this year's Reverie!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:16.28,Main,,0,0,0,,If possible, I wish to learn...Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,what it was the Nefertari kings of the past did to the world!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:30.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh...Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Behave yourself, Vivi-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama, how are you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:58.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Not well. I might not live much longer...Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:01.15,Main,,0,0,0,,If only my daughter would find a husband before it's too late.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not fair! You're using your illness against me again!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got tons of pictures of potential suitors!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Throw them away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.67,Captions,,0,0,175,,East Blue - LoguetownDialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:26.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your enthronement, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Our hotel was built exclusively for royal families who attend the Reverie every four years.Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We do hope you enjoy your stay.Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:42.73,Main,,0,0,3,,It isn't not-not-so-bad.Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:42.73,Captions,,0,0,240,,Queen of the Goa Kingdom Sarie NantokanetteDialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, darling?Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nothing special.Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,All it offers is a view of the scaffold where Gold Roger was executed.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,W-well, please do ease the fatigue of your travel here...Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,King Sterry.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:06:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I will. Now be gone from my sight, trash.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:02.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:15.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The countries of the world are in a restless state...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:18.73,Narrator,,0,0,0,,due to the Reverie that takes place at the center of the world...Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:23.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,in the Holy Land of Mariejois, every four years.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:30.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Here, at the very highest of conferences, fifty leaders will come together...Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:35.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to discuss and debate the world's most serious topics...Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.58,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and agree upon a shared direction of the future.Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:47.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But due to the prudent natures of the most powerful of leaders, the meetings are not always calm.Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:55.62,Main,,0,0,3,,The leader of the Happo Navy - Don Chinjao...Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:59.86,Captions,,0,0,173,,West Blue - Kano KingdomDialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:59.86,Main,,0,0,3,,I mean, the new leader Sai is not back yet, is he?Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Since Straw Hat and the others  took down the Donquixote Family,Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,our enemy can't buy weapons from them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, the war is over.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems we will make it to the Reverie in time.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,There are so many things I need to say!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:23.28,Captions,,0,0,240,,Beneath the Red Line, The Ryugu KingdomDialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:27.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:28.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-sama made a promise to me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,When we meet again, he's going to take me on a walk in a real forest on the surface!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.98,Captions,,0,0,240,,The Princess of the Ryugu Kingdom, ShirahoshiDialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, Luffy-kun will be able to take you much farther if you want!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:52.03,Main,,0,0,0,,But on this trip, we're going straight up to Mariejois.Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Your brothers and the Neptune Army will be there with you, Princess Shirahoshi!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh goodness...Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:04.06,Main,,0,0,3,,Father, what if we let Shirahoshi skip this one, mi-re-do?Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:04.06,Captions,,0,0,240,,Prince of the Ryugu Kingdom, RyuboshiDialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:09.71,Captions,,0,0,240,,Prince of the Ryugu Kingdom, ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:07.27,Main,,0,0,3,,Yeah! We got tons of signatures on the petition...Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.56,Main,,0,0,3,,that asks to relocate Fishman Island!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Mambo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:18.85,Main,,0,0,3,,That is like saying we don't trust humans-jamon.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:18.85,Captions,,0,0,240,,King of the Ryugu Kingdom, NeptuneDialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:24.72,Captions,,0,0,240,,Prince of the Ryugu Kingdom, FukaboshiDialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:24.72,Main,,0,0,3,,Shirahoshi, what did you learn from the Straw Hats?Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:28.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This meeting is what our mother Otohime  was looking forward to.Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:37.30,Captions,,0,0,240,,South Blue, Evil Black Drum KingdomDialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wapol-sama! I have a report!Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:46.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The kingdom you once ruled, the Drum Kingdom, has a new name. It's the Sakura Kingdom now!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:49.55,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that Dalton will be attending the Reverie as its king.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:52.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! The Sakura Kingdom?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn that Dalton...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I can do to drag him down at the Reverie?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:05.62,Captions,,0,0,240,,Grand Line Sakura KingdomDialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:05.62,Main,,0,0,3,,What did you say, Dr. Kureha? Are you serious?Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:08.65,Captions,,0,0,240,,King of the Sakura Kingdom, DaltonDialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:08.65,Main,,0,0,3,,Why do you all look so unhappy?Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I said that I'll be your ship's doctor.Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy?Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:17.80,Captions,,0,0,240,,Kingdom of Passion DressrosaDialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:17.80,Main,,0,0,3,,What?! Can I come too?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can! Would you like to come as my lady-in-waiting?Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd love to! Thank you, Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be excited, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I am!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can wear my mother's dress!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! That would be great!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:41.35,Captions,,0,0,175,,Prodence KingdomDialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.79,Main,,0,0,3,,King Riku! I turned down the battleship escort!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:47.02,Captions,,0,0,240,,King of the Prodence Kingdom Elizabello IIDialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.02,Main,,0,0,3,,Would you like to accompany me to the Holy Land?Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:54.07,Captions,,0,0,240,,King of Dressrosa Riku Dold IIIDialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.44,Main,,0,0,3,,Why does everyone think it's going to be a vacation?Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.91,Main,,0,0,3,,What's wrong with that?Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:57.31,Main,,0,0,3,,The Reverie is like a festival!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:10:00.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Luffy's group...Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey... turn a bit starboard...Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.78,0:10:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Like this?Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... a bit more.Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Put some spirit into it! Or we'll sink!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:22.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Because you jumped off the elephant all of a sudden, we're all worn out! Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Once again I can savor the joy of being alive...Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,But... I'll make you pay for it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:37.48,Main,,0,0,0,,See... we're off course again.Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Turn to port...Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Leave it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:47.11,Main,,0,0,0,,See?! She's full of spirit...Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! We really are on the water!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:55.93,Captions,,0,0,240,,Member of the Mink Musketeers CarrotDialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:55.93,Main,,0,0,3,,This big heavy boat feels like it's floating in the air!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:10.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot, why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I decided to tag along!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:20.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:20.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:20.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:20.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:20.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:20.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:20.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:20.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:20.70,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:20.74,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:20.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:20.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:20.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:20.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:20.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:20.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:21.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:21.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:21.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:21.16,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:21.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:21.24,Captions,,0,0,0,,MUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:23.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:23.61,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:23.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:23.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:23.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:23.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:23.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:23.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:23.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:23.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:23.98,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:24.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:24.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:24.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:24.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:24.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:24.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:24.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:24.30,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:24.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:24.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,CHOMP!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Corpse!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,CRUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,CRUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,CRUNCH!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Too hard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we have to go back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do that! Wanda's going to be mad at me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be a bother to our saviors, Carrot?Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to go on an adventure at sea, along with Luffy and the others, even if it's the only chance I get.Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We are infiltrating the lair of an Emperor. This is no game!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! I'll do anything! Just take me with you! I won't cause any trouble! I even brought...Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:02.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Lunch!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Juice!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:04.99,Main,,0,0,0,,A snack!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,An extra shirt!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,How long do you think that'll last?Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,A good half day! Isn't the sea a big place?Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:18.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! It's going to take multiple days to get to Big Mom's territory?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Even on a straight route?! I can't believe the ocean is so big!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:26.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The ocean is like a wonderland!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never spent the night away from home!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:31.89,Main,,0,0,0,,A wonderland? We're in the ocean.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. You're on board now, so we'll have to deal with it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:38.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you defend yourself in a fight?Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you! I'll be alright...Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:44.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you eating my carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Pat her head, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close! You almost killed me! You're strong!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, you can have the carrot.Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy almost lost!Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, she is a good fighter.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro-san, when did you get up there? You really like heights.Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:24.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry. Let's eat.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, make something!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll do it,  so just watch the waves for me, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be 5000 Belly per person.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait! Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll drain all of our allowances!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:48.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:52.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Either I make the food, or you do it, Brook.Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:58.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If we leave it to Luffy-san, who knows what he'll make for us?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make something!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:01.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me!  I'll cook you a lot of delicious dishes!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't... Hey, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Food! Food! Food!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Can you even cook?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:25.80,Main,,0,0,0,,This is quite a large headline.Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,"The island, for decades veiled in mystery..."Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"was finally discovered."Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:41.76,Main,,0,0,0,,"The Revolutionary Army's general headquarters - Baltigo..."Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:43.15,Note,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army HQ has been discovered.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,"is in utter ruins!"Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:50.66,Note,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army HQ has been discovered.Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army got defeated?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you-gara were the son of Dragon the Revolutionary.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my brother!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:06.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo-san?! The brother you said you met at Dressrosa?Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:11.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he the Chief of Staff?! Then he's the second in command of the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of trio of brothers are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:17.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... this Dragon guy next to him is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's him! Remember what your grandpa told us two years ago!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The name of your father is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:29.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Dragon. He's a revolutionary!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The leader of the Revolutionary Army - Dragon.Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's your dad!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:41.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! This is my dad?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You're just now finding that out?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:48.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Luffy's father is  the leader of the Revolutionary Army?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Amazing! Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:56.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you look into him at all over the past two years?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:16:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Normal people would be at least a little bit curious if their father was such a famous figure!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin even worked under him while we were separated.Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! This is the first time I've seen him! He doesn't really look like me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm worried about Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it is hard to empathize with a picture.Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:23.51,Main,,0,0,0,,An anonymous source revealed the location of the headquarters.Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,But by the time the Navy and Cipher Pol arrived...Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,the Blackbeard Pirates had already laid the base to ruin.Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard?! Those bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:40.01,Main,,0,0,0,,But... why would Blackbeard, an Emperor, attack the Revolutionary Army?Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Back at Dressrosa, Sabo fought that champion guy.  Maybe that had something to do with it?Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.96,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Blackbeard clashed briefly with Cipher Pol before fleeing.Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:04.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The article doesn't say anything about any casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,If your-gara father or brother were captured or killed, it would've been the big headline.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,So I guess they're okay for now.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.43,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for cooking for us, but is that supposed to happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I forgot to turn off the stove!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Something exploded!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! A storm is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?! Electro?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hoist the sails!  The wind will rip them to shreds!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What about the fire?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The rain will put it out!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We're lucky!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.16,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing "lucky" about it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You help, too!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm half-dead!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:34.38,Captions,,0,0,170,,ZouDialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... Carrot is out at sea now?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:45.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us sooner, Bariete?Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:47.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry-saru, Wanda!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:52.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I told Carrot that she had to  tell everyone that she was going-saru.Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But she said...Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:58.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No way! If I tell anybody, they'll try to stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! She bribed you-teia, didn't she?Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Shock!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.03,0:19:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You caught me-saru...Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But Carrot didn't want to go behind your back, Wanda!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'm just glad we know where she is.Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I was more worried about her being missing.Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,She'll be safe if she's with Luffy's group.Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke-sama, please get some rest. I will have extra guards put in place.Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I suspect that our enemy has a Vivre Card.Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But how did they get it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I only hope that the card was lost with the ships Zunisha sank...Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll come back?Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We'd better be on the lookout.Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.95,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.55,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and pull me out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.36,Captions,,0,0,175,,In a Certain CountryDialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,As we thought, Jack-sama failed to rescue Joker!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That puts an end to our arrangment for those SMILE artificial Devil Fruits!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:42.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's a crying drunk today.Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... we can't make any more Gifters!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Joker! Oh, Joker!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you let yourself get beaten?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:13.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We were going to create the greatest crew ever, made up of just Devil Fruit users!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:24.99,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet...Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:40.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You were taken out by a bunch of upstart brats before that dream could come true!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Poor, poor Joker! It's all because he was such a terrible weakling...Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,But everyone's talking about Straw Hat these days. If you underestimate him...Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.09,0:23:20.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If I underestimate him...Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Then what?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:23:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He turned into an angry drunk!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:20.56,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kaidou-sama... Please calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.87,0:24:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy! Trafalgar Law!Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! They're from that generation, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:48.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Those brats think they're something just because they brought down a Warlord!Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,They must be aware that they messed with my business!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.78,0:25:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw them!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.07,0:25:17.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.03,0:25:20.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell those idiots from your generation this:Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,"Run away now while you can. All we've been doing is playing pirates"!!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Eustass "Captain" Kid!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.14,0:25:49.94,Captions,,950,0,350,,Back on the Thousand SunnyDialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's cold!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.74,0:25:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We patched up the roof!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.46,0:25:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, good work.Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.02,0:25:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! The storm has passed! And we patched up the roof that blew off!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.64,0:25:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We kept the food I made safe, so let's eat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.30,0:26:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! Food! We're starving!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it that good?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.42,0:26:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,My specialty curry!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we can't eat uncooked rice!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.27,0:26:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that bitter purple stuff?Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.76,0:26:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's full of fish bones.Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.96,0:26:21.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Too much jam!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something sticky and light blue.Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.42,0:26:27.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What did we do to deserve this?Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:31.02,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you guys be so rude after I took the time to cook this!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.83,0:26:36.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuck!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.89,0:26:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,See, we told you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.90,0:26:39.91,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't edible!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't flip the table over!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.14,0:26:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you waste food! Sanji-san would be mad if he heard about this!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.81,0:26:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,All the food we loaded... it's gone!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:57.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I messed up a lot, so I used all of it.Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:27:01.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! That was a week's  worth of food for all of us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:03.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were hungry!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.43,0:27:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not funny!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.59,0:27:10.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.76,0:27:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.02,0:27:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm starving...Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:19.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san! Help us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:27.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, in just the first day of Luffy's journey... The crew was at risk of starvation.Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.42,0:27:34.75,Captions,,0,0,300,,A Few Days Later, Big Mom's ShipDialogue: 0,0:27:29.42,0:27:34.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Ship! Ship! Ship! Ship!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.36,0:27:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought this was snow, but...Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Cotton Candy Flurry-soir!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That Transponder Snail's been ringing off the hook...Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's receiving warning signals-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.79,0:27:56.21,Main,,0,0,0,,That means we're in  Mama's territory now-soufflé.Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.21,0:27:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Does the signal extend to that spot over there?Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:03.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a quick learner! That's Tarte 28.Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:09.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It is an outpost where a platoon from  the Big Mom Pirates is standing ready-millefeuille!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If we weren't on one of Mama's ships, they'd attack us with a rapid "Boom"!Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.51,0:28:21.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, have you made up your mind? Don't be so stubborn.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:29.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow Germa 66's example and swear allegiance to the Big Mom Pirates-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.02,0:28:33.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That is your father's wish-amour.Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.94,0:28:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about him! It makes me sick to my stomach!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.58,0:28:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Our relationship has already been broken off!Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm only going there to clear things up.Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try to act tough.Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.10,0:29:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is in a more  welcoming mood than you might think.Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.85,0:29:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, she knows you're that foolish Straw Hat's comrade-il vous plaît.Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.53,0:29:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But she admires how you were once a chef at the sea reastaurant in the East Blue-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.24,0:29:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Depending on your skill, she may offer you an even better position-jour.Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.97,0:29:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that!Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.73,0:29:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen! The only use for these hands of mine... is to cook food for my friends!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.42,0:29:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,For that purpose, I even trained myself in hell!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.67,0:29:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're missing my food and crying about it right now...Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:52.64,Main,,0,0,0,,How absurd!Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.26,0:29:57.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I would never make a dish for the kind of people...Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.14,0:30:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,who would take out of their own comrades without a second thought!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're talking about Pekoms, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.65,0:30:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He let his personal feelings interfere with his work. Bege did the right thing.Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.14,0:30:14.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago.Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Vito!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We got a photo of Pudding-sama from Whole Cake Island-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.93,0:30:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,So you can prepare yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.16,0:30:31.64,Main,,0,0,0,,They know it's hard to marry someone you've never met. How nice of them to send this.Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.64,0:30:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, you idiot. I'm not getting married!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.02,0:30:37.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Just take a look.Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:40.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay away or I'll kick you to death!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.35,0:30:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, come on.Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.79,0:30:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out...Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.44,0:30:54.93,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your bride-to-be...Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:31:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,The 35th daughter of the Charlotte Family. Charlotte Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.73,0:31:03.83,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Timing: Lance  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Graphics: Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll